				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ききゅああああーっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ポケモン
・GRIDX=15、GRIDZ=11
・r11で戦闘し倒したりした場合
　殿堂入りでココに復帰</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-05T08:46:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
